Singularity.PlanarRuns.IsRegularAt.succ.type:
∀ {σ : Type u_1} {θ : ℝ} {k : Type u_2} [inst : Field k] {w : ℕ → Bool} {m : ℕ}
  {h : MvPolynomial σ (HahnSeries (Singularity.PlanarRuns.CornerExp θ) k)},
